  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6abea9b11b02c7a8ad311dd0",
      "text": "曜日が同じ月",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cae",
      "text": "from [2026/09/30]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb0",
      "text": "お盆休みが取れなかった代わりの日程を12月に探していて気がついたのだが、9月と12月って[曜日]が同じなんだな[KNo.804C.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880205
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb1",
      "text": " 30日間（9月）、31日間（10月）、30日間（11月）と来て計91日間だから[7の倍数]になる",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880213
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb2",
      "text": " 当たり前といえば当たり前なんだけど、今の今まで気が付かなかった",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb3",
      "text": " 関心を向けたことがなかった",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb4",
      "text": " おもしろい！[はるひ.icon][yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9c20000000000934cbd",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880194,
      "updated": 1790880195
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb5",
      "text": "こうなるらしい[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880196
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb6",
      "text": " table:曜日が同じ月",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb7",
      "text": "  平年\t[うるう年]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880234
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb8",
      "text": "  1月・10月\t1月・4月・7月",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cb9",
      "text": "  2月・3月・11月\t2月・8月",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cba",
      "text": "  4月・7月\t3月・11月",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1790880178,
      "updated": 1790880178
    },
    {
      "id": "6abea9b20000000000934cbb",
